~ defector_start
Defector (weak, startled): No— no— stay back!
Defector (struggling): I won’t go back. I won’t!
- I’m not here to take you back. => defector_recognition
- Who are you? => defector_recognition
- …(silent) => defector_recognition

~ defector_recognition
Defector (looking up, frozen): That armor…
Defector (whisper): By the Crescent… it’s really you.
Defector: The Commander who vanished.
- I don’t remember that name. => defector_lore_1
- You know me? => defector_lore_1
- Stop talking. You’re hurt. => defector_lore_1

~ defector_lore_1
Defector (bitter laugh): Of course you don’t remember.
Defector: They never let commanders keep their memories.
Defector: Loyalty burns cleaner when there’s nothing left to doubt.
- What did the Order do to us? => defector_lore_2
- What are the monsters? => defector_lore_2

~ defector_lore_2
Defector (voice shaking): The beasts aren’t summoned.
Defector: They’re *bound*.
Defector: People— soldiers— villagers—
Defector: reshaped through armor, rituals, and control sigils.
Defector: The Crescent doesn’t rule through fear.
Defector: It rules through *ownership*.
- And me? => defector_lore_3
- Why tell me this? => defector_lore_3

~ defector_lore_3
Defector (hesitant): You were different.
Defector: You questioned the bindings.
Defector: You delayed executions.
Defector: That’s why they erased you instead of killing you.
Defector: A clean weapon is better than a broken symbol.
- Then why are you attacking me? => defector_break
- You don’t have to fight. => defector_break

~ defector_break
Defector (clutching head): Stop— stop saying it!
Defector: The armor listens!
Defector: If I hesitate— it will—
Defector (shouting): I WON’T GO BACK!

do GameState.defector_attack.emit()
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit()


- [Defend yourself] => defector_fight
- [Try to reach him] => defector_respond

~ defector_fight
do GameState.full_attack.emit() 
do GameState.defector_hurt.emit()
[wait=0.4] => defector_respond

~ defector_respond
Defector (roaring): ORDER ABOVE ALL!
do GameState.defector_attack.emit()
do GameState.request_attack.emit()
[wait=0.01]
do GameState.defector_hurt.emit()
[wait=0.4]
do GameState.full_attack.emit()
do GameState.defector_hurt.emit()

Defector: [wait=1] They’re watching—!
Defector: Through you! Through the armor!

- [Strike] => defector_end
- [Disarm] => defector_end

~ defector_end
do GameState.full_attack.emit()
do GameState.defector_hurt.emit()
do GameState.defector_hurt.emit()

do GameState.defector_idle.emit()

Defector (collapsing): You still don’t understand…
Defector: The Crescent isn’t a place.
Defector: It’s a *promise*.

Defector: [wait=2] If you reach the Gate…
Defector: He will offer you the truth.
Defector: And take everything else.

=> END
